{"4771310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MANDATUM", "steam_appid": 4771310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4982650], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/cdde469727f011287ded9179a15009d2.avif?t=1786354036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras_big/cdde469727f011287ded9179a15009d2.webp?t=1786354036 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RIG THE ELECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yo, you ever wanted to rig a local election with your buddies and cause total mayhem while doing it? Then <strong>Mandatum</strong> is your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/b07f9ab8521f72abbd33fe37be2009ca.poster.avif?t=1786354036\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/b07f9ab8521f72abbd33fe37be2009ca.webm?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/b07f9ab8521f72abbd33fe37be2009ca.mp4?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIE. CHEAT. WIN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your crew have one job: make sure <strong>The Boss</strong> wins the election no matter what. Fair play? Nah. History is written by the winners, right? So we’re doing whatever it takes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AVOID THE POLICE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Boss is literally your everything. Keep that man alive, keep him smiling, and most importantly — keep him far away from the Policeman. If he goes down… the whole thing falls apart fast and things get really messy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/7e9bf42e66948fdcf79a60692f5f0350.poster.avif?t=1786354036\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/7e9bf42e66948fdcf79a60692f5f0350.webm?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/7e9bf42e66948fdcf79a60692f5f0350.mp4?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORK TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You each play a different role — every single one is wonderfully chaotic in its own way. Unique abilities, shady tools, and some very questionable life choices. But that’s the fun! You gotta use your skills together or you’re all in trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/064513b65233d3c7a5c28ec18beedb12.poster.avif?t=1786354036\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/064513b65233d3c7a5c28ec18beedb12.webm?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/064513b65233d3c7a5c28ec18beedb12.mp4?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAUSE CHAOS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a solo hero game. You win as a team or you fail as a team. Expect lots of voice chat, crazy plans, last-second saves, and laughing like crazy when everything goes wonderfully wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/bea227bac30613fd95f6c742b7a79031.poster.avif?t=1786354036\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/bea227bac30613fd95f6c742b7a79031.webm?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/bea227bac30613fd95f6c742b7a79031.mp4?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE HISTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you love chaotic co-op games full of coordination, funny moments, and ridiculous teamwork… Mandatum is seriously addictive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/6e4d624f180374e6eec1b52656b6c3b6.poster.avif?t=1786354036\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/6e4d624f180374e6eec1b52656b6c3b6.webm?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/6e4d624f180374e6eec1b52656b6c3b6.mp4?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missions for help Boss win election</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini Games  like Archery at a live target</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of new funny cut scenes. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Graphic improves - maybe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bug fix - maybe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asphalted roads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stray animal shelters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Salary Increase for all budgeters</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Come make democracy great again… the fun way</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/cdde469727f011287ded9179a15009d2.avif?t=1786354036\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras_big/cdde469727f011287ded9179a15009d2.webp?t=1786354036 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RIG THE ELECTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yo, you ever wanted to rig a local election with your buddies and cause total mayhem while doing it? Then <strong>Mandatum</strong> is your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/b07f9ab8521f72abbd33fe37be2009ca.poster.avif?t=1786354036\" width=1170 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/b07f9ab8521f72abbd33fe37be2009ca.webm?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771310/extras/b07f9ab8521f72abbd33fe37be2009ca.mp4?t=1786354036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIE. CHEAT. WIN.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\